          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best protein cookie is one that adds real protein to a treat you would eat anyway, without hiding a second serving of calories behind the front label. On the numbers, Quest's Peanut Butter Chocolate Chip and Double Chocolate Chip cookies do that best, with 15 g or so of milk protein for about 210 to 220 calories and about 1 g of sugar. The Legendary Foods Protein Pastry delivers even more protein per calorie if a pastry will do, and Lenny & Larry's is the only confirmed dairy-free option, best bought in the 2 oz size or split on purpose.
          </p>
